        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by deleting Schedule 4A. Deletion of Schedule 4c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_II__cl_35",
