      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (d)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9__para_a__subpara_iii__subpara_A",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "A",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the word \"thereafter\" the word \"next\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9__para_a__subpara_iii__subpara_B",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "B",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the full stop at the end of that paragraph the words \"; and\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9__para_a__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (d) the following paragraph: \"(e) thereafter, by any deduction falling to be so made pursuant to section 44A.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (5) the following subsections: \"(5A) The amount ascertained under subsection (4) or (5) for any relevant year in respect of a company shall be disregarded for the purposes of section 43 unless the Director General is satisfied that the shareholders of that company on the last day of the basis period for that relevant year in which such amount is ascertained were substantially the same as the shareholders of that company on the first day of the basis period for the year of assessment in which such amount would otherwise be deductible under that section and such amount disregarded shall not be allowed as a deduction in subsequent years of assessment. (5B) For the purpose of subsection (5A)— (a) the shareholders of the company at any date shall be substantially the same as the shareholders at any other date if on both those dates— (i) more than fifty per cent of the paid-up capital in respect of the ordinary share of the company is held by or on behalf of the same persons; and (ii) more than fifty per cent of the nominal value of the allotted shares in respect of ordinary share in the company is held by or on behalf of the same persons; and (b) shares in the company held by or on behalf of another company shall be deemed to be held by the shareholders of the last mentioned company. (5c) In subsection (5B), \"ordinary share\" means any share other than a share which carries only a right to any dividend which is of— (a) a fixed amount or at a fixed rate per cent of the nominal value of the shares; or (b) a fixed rate per cent of the profits of the company. (5D) Where there is a substantial change in the shareholders of a company referred to in subsection (5A), the Minister may under special circumstances exempt that company from the provisions of that subsection.\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_II__cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (8), by substituting for the words \"and in respect of contributions to public libraries\" the words \", to public libraries\". Special provision relating to section 44"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "IV",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_50",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_51",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_52",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_53",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_54",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_55",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_56"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS TO THE STAMP ACT 1949 Commencement of amendments to the Stamp Act 1949"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_50",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "50",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_50__subsec_2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "( 1 ) Sections 51, 52, 53, 55 and 56 are deemed to have come into operation on 1 October 2005."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_50__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_50",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 54 comes into operation on 1 January 2006. Amendment of section 21"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_51",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "51",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Stamp Act 1949, which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Chapter, is amended in subsection 21(2) by deleting the words \"or three ringgit as the case may require\". Amendment of section 43"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_52",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "52",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for paragraph 43(5)(b) the following paragraph: \"(b) if it is stamped after the expiration of thirty days after it has been received in Malaysia, on payment in addition to the stamp duty of a penalty of— (i) twenty-five ringgit or five per centum of the amount of the deficient duty, whichever sum be the greater, if the instrument is stamped within three months after the time for stamping; (ii) fifty ringgit or ten per centum of the amount of the deficient duty, whichever sum be the greater, if the instrument is stamped later than three months but not later than six months after the time for stamping; or (iii) one hundred ringgit or twenty per centum of the amount of the deficient duty, whichever sum be the greater, in any other case.\". Amendment of section 80"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_53",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "53",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_53__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_53__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_53__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 80 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_53__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by deleting the words \"instrument or\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_53__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(1A) The Minister of Finance may in any particular case— (i) exempt from duty any instrument which would otherwise be chargeable under this Act; or (ii) reduce or remit the duties with which any instrument is chargeable.\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_53__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by deleting the words \"any instrument or\". New section 80A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_54",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "54",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 80 the following section: \"Fund for Tax Refund 80A. (1) There shall be paid from time to time into the Fund established under section 111 B of the Income Tax Act 1967 such amount of duty collected under this Act as may be authorized by the Minister. (2) The money of the Fund referred to in subsection (1), shall be applied for the making of a refund of any duty or any other payment required to be made by the Collector under this Act. (3) Section 14A of the Financial Procedure Act 1957 shall not apply to any refund of any duty or any other payment required to be made under this Act. (4) Where the Collector is authorized or required by this Act to make any refund of any duty or any other payment required under this Act, he shall certify the amount of the sum to be refunded or paid and cause the refund or payment to be made forthwith.\". Amendment of First Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_55",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "55",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The First Schedule of the principal Act is amended in item 22 by inserting after subitem (5) the following subitem: \"(6) Being the security for securing the payment or repayment of money for the purchase of goods (within the meaning given under the First Schedule of the Hire Purchase Act 1967) in accordance with the Syariah principle of Al Bai Bithaman Ajil. Amendment of Fifth Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_56",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "56",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Fifth Schedule of the principal Act is amended in paragraph 8 by substituting for the words \"Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange\" the words \"Bursa Malaysia\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_I__cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Finance Act 2005. Amendment of Acts"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_I__cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Income Tax Act 1967 [Act 53], the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976 [Act 169], the Stamp Act 1949 [Act 378], the Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967 [Act 543] and the Labuan Offshore Business Activity Tax Act 1990 [Act 445] are amended in the manner specified in Chapters II, III, IV, V and VI respectively."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "V",
