      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS TO THE LABUAN OFESHORE BUSINESS ACTIVITY TAX ACT 1990 Amendment of section 18"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_65",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "65",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Labuan Offshore Business Activity Tax Act 1990 is amended in subsection 18(1) by substituting for the words \"a Deputy Director General, an Assistant Director General, a Senior Assistant or Assistant Director, of Inland Revenue referred to in\" the words \"any officer appointed under\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_57",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "57",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sections 60 and 64 come into operation on 1 January 2006. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_58",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "58",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Petroleum (Income Tax) Act 1967, which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Chapter, is amended in paragraph 2(l)(a), in the definition of \"authorized officer\" by substituting for the words \"(1), (2), (3) or (4)\" the words \" ( 1 ) or (2)\". Amendment of section 39"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_59",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "59",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 39 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: \"(4) Where in a year of assessment- (a) any assessment made in respect of any chargeable person for any year of assessment has been determined by the court on appeal or review; or (b) any exemption granted to any chargeable person under this Act has been withdrawn for failing to comply with any condition imposed in granting such exemption, the Director General may in the first mentioned year of assessment or within six years after its expiration make an assessment in respect of that chargeable person for any year of assessment for the purpose of giving effect to the determination or withdrawal, as the case may be.\". New section 50A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_60",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "60",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 50 the following section: \"Fund for Tax Refund 50A. (1) There shall be paid from time to time into the Fund established under section 111B of the Income Tax Act 1967 such amount of tax collected under this Act as may be authorized by the Minister. (2) The money of the Fund referred to in subsection (1), shall be applied for the making of a refund of an amount of tax paid in excess of the amount payable as ascertained in section 50. (3) Section 14A of the Financial Procedure Act 1957 shall not apply to any refund in excess of the amount payable as ascertained in section 50.\". Amendment of section 69"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_61",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "61",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_61__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_61__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_61__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 69 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_61__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_61",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(2) Any officer appointed under the law relating to income tax may exercise any function of the Director General under this Act (not being a function exercis- able by a statutory order or a function exercisable under subsection 70(1) and section 82).\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_61__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_61",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting subsections (3) and (4); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_61__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_61",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (5), by substituting for the words \"under subsection (4) by Senior Assistant or Assistant Director of Inland Revenue\" the words \"under subsection (2) by the appointed officers.\". Amendment of section 77"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_62",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "62",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 77 of the principal Act is amended in subsection (1) by deleting the words \", the Director of Inland Revenue, Sabah, or the Director of Inland Revenue, Sarawak,\". Amendment of section 78"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_63",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "63",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 78 of the principal Act is amended by deleting the words \", to the Director of Inland Revenue, Sabah, to the Director of Inland Revenue, Sarawak,\". Amendment of section 81"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V__cl_64",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "64",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/eng@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 81 the following section: \"81, Where the Director General is authorized or required by this Act to make any refund or repayment, he shall certify the amount of the sum to be refunded or repaid and cause the refund or repayment to be made forthwith.\"."
      }
    }
  ]
}
